GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_TanyaTeamowner> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_TanyaTeamowner> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Actor_TanyaTeamowner> ;
    narr:childCount "23"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "a3b3776b00e91d42f37e53859ea1cd3275e9dfe7" ;
    narr:narration """Tanya's voice here spans a product thesis, a beta relationship, a channel-strategy thread, and a newer brand-identity thread. The thesis runs from [renaming the product to installable expertise](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24) through [the technical moat of extracting citable perspective from documents](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_26) to [the target market of experts packaging work in static forms](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_28) and [the bottleneck framing of delegated expert work](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_30), held as [a platform-over-toolbox ambition](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_32) while distribution stays exploratory: [seeding perspectives from people she knows](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_34) and [a podcast-driven marketplace](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_7). A grounding thread runs through [her fiancé as beta tester, not sales target](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_44), [her prolific verbal feedback](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_54), and [the admitted hard edge of users not knowing what to say](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_58). A channel thread reframes [the product as a distribution channel, not a phone number](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_8), with [the felt value of the phone-number medium](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_15), [its fraud and maintenance cost](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_21), [an enterprise-only SMS proposal](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_46), [a deferred tier-mapping decision](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_47), and [a meta-claim that an earlier framing was a product experiment that leaked into the graph](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_7). A newer thread extends the thesis toward brand identity: [design tokens for product language as the product's precursor](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_11), [AI identities as a brand's identity](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_13), [the aspirational one-shot-a-website-that-thinks-like-the-brand question](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_15), [the not-yet-delivered AI-perspective-as-deck-alternative](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_17), and [the lossy-interpretation cost of static deliverables](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_19).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24> ;
